        <section class="c-page__body" id="maincontent">
            <section class="c-container c-container--has-bg-color u-pure-white-bg c-container--inset "
    id="details">

    
    <section class="c-container__blocks">

        <div class="o-layout o-layout--center">
                            <div class="o-layout__item u-2/3@desktop">
    <div class="c-col c-col-text-area u-transparent-bg" >
    	
        
                    <p class="c-drop-cap lead-p"><span class="TextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">Our ★★★★★ ‘gorgeously enchanting’ (</span></span><em><span class="TextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">Sunday Mirror</span></span></em><span class="TextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">) </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">and ★★★★★ ‘truly magical’</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8"> (</span></span><em><span class="TextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">Broadway World</span></span></em><span class="TextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">)</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8"> </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">new musical </span></span><strong><span class="TextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">Pinocchio </span></span></strong><span class="TextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8" lang="EN-GB" xml:lang="EN-GB" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">returns to London’s Globe Theatre in winter 2026</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW203242175 BCX8">.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW203242175 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Dreaming of a life beyond his traditional town, restless maverick Geppetto makes a magical wooden puppet called Pinocchio. Together they set out to find family and discover the wonder of being human.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Bring everyone together for ‘one of the best family shows around’ </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">★★★★ </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">(</span><i><span data-contrast="auto">The Telegraph</span></i><span data-contrast="auto">) – or treat yourself to ‘a great night out’ </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">★★★★ </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">(</span><i><span data-contrast="auto">The Reviews Hub).</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Full of fabulous live music and packed with ‘blissful silliness… and boisterous humour’ </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">★★★★ </span></b>(<i><span data-contrast="auto">The</span></i><b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></b><i><span data-contrast="auto">Guardian</span></i><span data-contrast="auto">), this is ‘a wonderful festive treat’ </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">★★★★ </span></b>(<i><span data-contrast="auto">Independent</span></i><span data-contrast="auto">) for everybody age 5 and up.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none">Do not miss this </span><span data-contrast="none">★★★★★</span><span data-contrast="none"> ‘beautiful new musical&#8217; (</span><i><span data-contrast="none">WhatsOnStage</span></i><span data-contrast="none">), written by </span><b><span data-contrast="none">Charlie Josephine</span></b><span data-contrast="none"> (</span><i><span data-contrast="none">Cowbois</span></i><span data-contrast="none">, Royal Court) and </span><b><span data-contrast="none">Jim Fortune</span></b><span data-contrast="none"> (</span><i><span data-contrast="none">Mr Gum and the Dancing Bear</span></i><span data-contrast="none">, National), directed by Globe Associate Artistic Director </span><b><span data-contrast="none">Sean Holmes</span></b><span data-contrast="none">.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></p>
<blockquote>
<p class="lead-p">&#8216;What&#8217;s love? Well that&#8217;s a big thing to explain.’</p>
</blockquote>
            </div>
</div>
                            <div class="o-layout__item u-1/3@desktop">
    <div class="c-col c-col-text-area c-col--has-bg-color u-teal-black-bg" >
    	
        
                    <p class="lead-p"><strong><i class="fal fa-info-circle"></i> DETAILS</strong></p>
<p><i class="fal fa-ticket"></i><strong>  TICKETS</strong><br />
<strong> Galleries (Seating) </strong>£89– £29*<br />
*includes a £3 per order transaction fee and a £1 per ticket restoration levy</p>
<p><strong> Standing </strong>£10, £5</p>
<p><strong>Half-price seated tickets for under-16s are available for all performances.</strong></p>
<p><i class="fal fa-map-marked"></i> This event is <strong>on-site</strong> in the <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/visit/getting-here/">Globe Theatre</a>.</p>
<p><i class="fal fa-clock"></i><strong> Running time </strong>2 hours 10 minutes, including a 20 minute interval</p>
<p class="smaller-p"><strong><a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/policies/terms-conditions/">Terms and conditions</a></strong><br />
<span data-teams="true">All under 16s must be accompanied by an adult, and cannot be sat separately. Prices subject to change, book now to secure the best tickets at the best prices.</span></p>
<p>Artwork: Lisa Sheehan<br />
Art Direction: Kim Garrity</p>
            </div>
</div>
