                                    alt="Audience members watch Pinocchio on stage. The wooden puppet of Pinocchio is held by Aya Nakamura as Puppeteer and Lee Braithwaite as Pinocchio. Lucy McCormick as Blue Fairy sits on a blue crescent moon which hangs from above the stage. Kerry Frampton as Snail Maid stands on stage right. 'Pinocchio' in large gold letters is above the stage."
                                    title="Credit: Johan Persson"
