					<div class="o-layout o-layout--flush">
			                                                <div class="o-layout__item c-col-bio-single">
                            <h3 class="c-col-bio__role u-h3">Associate Director</h3>
                                                            <a href="#0"
                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Roberta Zuric'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Roberta is a theatre director and facilitator. Previous work at Shakespeare’s Globe includes <em>Troilus and Cressida, Macbeth, The Duchess of Malfi, The Winter&#8217;s Tale.</em></p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/roberta-zuric/">View full biography</a>
