                                                                    </a>
                                                    </div>
                    				                                            <div class="o-layout__item c-col-bio-single">
                            <h3 class="c-col-bio__role u-h3">Book and Lyrics</h3>
                                                            <a href="#0"
                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Charlie Josephine'
                                data-dialog-content='<p><span data-teams="true">Their play <em>Cowbois</em>, which Charlie also co-directed with Sean Holmes, enjoyed a successful run at The RSC and the Royal Court in 2024. In 2022, their play <em>I, Joan</em> opened to great acclaim at Shakespeare’s Globe. Other work at Shakespeare&#8217;s Globe includes <em>Metamorphoses </em>and<em> As You Like It.</em></span></p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/charlie-josephine/">View full biography</a>
                                '

                                                                    data-dialog-img='<figure class="c-col-bio__mugshot">
                                        <img
                                            src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2021/09/CharlieJosephine.jpg?resize=320%2C320&gravity"
                                            alt="Charlie Josephine wearing a grey t-shirt and looking directly at the camera."
                                            title="CharlieJosephine">
                                    </figure>'
                                                                class="c-dialog--open c-link">
                                                                            <h4 class="c-col-bio__name u-h5">Charlie Josephine</h4>
                                                                    </a>
                                                    </div>
