                                data-dialog-title='Alice Walters'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Alice is Casting Associate at Shakespeare’s Globe. She supports Head of Casting Becky Paris in the casting of all in-house productions, events, and workshops for the Globe Theatre and Sam Wanamaker Playhouse.</p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/alice-walters/">View full biography</a>
