                                data-dialog-title='Becky Paris CDG'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Becky is Head of Casting at Shakespeare’s Globe, overseeing the casting of all in-house productions, events and workshops for the Globe Theatre and Sam Wanamaker Playhouse.</p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/becky-paris/">View full biography</a>
