                                data-dialog-content='<p>Previous work at Shakespeare&#8217;s Globe includes <em>The Merry Wives of Windsor</em>, <em>Much Ado About Nothing</em>,<em> The Winter’s Tale</em>, <em>Hamlet</em>, <em>Metamorphoses</em>, <em>Henry VI</em> and <em>Richard III.</em></p>
<br>
