                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Benjamin Holder'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Benjamin hails from Warrington in Northwest England. He studied music at St Catherine’s College, Oxford, where he was a repetiteur scholar with New Chamber Opera. Thereafter, he studied piano accompaniment at the Royal Academy of Music under Michael Dussek.</p>
<br>
