                                data-dialog-title='Jim Fortune'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Jim Fortune is a songwriter and composer of musicals. His previous work for Shakespeare’s Globe includes <em>Pinocchio</em><em>, Twelfth Night </em>and <em>A Midsummer Night’s Dream.</em></p>
<br>
