                                data-dialog-title='Liz Flint'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Liz Flint is a Voice, Dialect and Singing Coach working across the West End, regional theatre and film. She is currently Voice Coach on <em>Paddington: The Musical</em> (Savoy Theatre), <em>The Hunger Games: On Stage</em> (Troubadour Canary Wharf), <em>Anything Goes</em> (Mill at Sonning) and <em>Matilda</em> (Volksoper Wien).</p>
